Spec: Platform-key Java device identity

Purpose:
  Prove possession of the locally generated device key with standard mTLS and owner trust.

Owns:
  ./DeviceIdentity.java

Must:
  Accept a platform PrivateKey handle without requiring private-key export.
  Produce P-256 CSRs through pinned Bouncy Castle PKIX and use platform TLS for data protection.
  Validate owner chain, certificate lifetime, both device EKUs, fixed server name and the exact approved peer SPKI.
  Reject wrong root, wrong peer, expired certificate or unsupported key without insecure fallback.
  Expose a fixed-peer platform TLS socket factory and matching trust manager for Agent HTTP without exporting the key; validate full device profile inside trust callbacks.
